/diff for pi: open the repo in VS Code, one diff tab per changed file.

INSTALL

    pi install git:github.com/sueszli/pi-diff

    needs: git, `code` on PATH

USE

    /diff            working tree vs HEAD
    /diff main       working tree vs main
    /diff HEAD~3     working tree vs 3 commits back
    /diff --max 50   raise tab cap (default 20)

    modified/renamed  -> code --diff <base> <file>
    added/untracked   -> opens file
    deleted           -> opens base version

